dvm: Data Volume Monitor
dvm:
dvm: vnStat is a network traffic monitor for Linux that keeps a log of
dvm: daily network traffic for the selected interface(s). vnStat isn't a
dvm: packetsniffer. The traffic information is analyzed from the /proc
dvm: filesystem so vnStat can be used without root permissions.
dvm: This program is open source (GPL).
